        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Howard Schnellenberger, Tom Olivadotti\n- Organizations: Miami Hurricanes, Nebraska Cornhuskers, Princeton Tigers, Boston College Eagles\n- Roles: head coach, defensive coordinator, American football coach\n- Events: 1983 Orange Bowl, 1983 college football championship season\n\nFacts:\n- Howard Leslie Schnellenberger was born on March 16, 1934, and he is a retired American football coach who served extensively in both professional and college football.\n- In 1983, Howard Schnellenberger was the fifth-year head coach of the Miami Hurricanes.\n- In 1983, the Miami Hurricanes finished the season with an 11–1 record after defeating the Nebraska Cornhuskers in the Orange Bowl.\n- Tom Olivadotti coached in college for the Princeton Tigers, Boston College Eagles, and Miami Hurricanes.\n- Tom Olivadotti was the defensive coordinator for the Miami Hurricanes' 1983 championship team.",
